<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Happy 2nd Monthsary, Aki!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: #ffe6eb;
      color: #4b2c2c;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5em;
      color: #d6336c;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .letter {
      background: #fff0f5;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 20px;
      max-width: 600px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .letter p {
      font-size: 1.2em;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .photos {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: center;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .photos img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .music {
      margin: 30px 0;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #a06767;
    }

    @media (min-width: 700px) {
      h1 {
        font-size: 3em;
      }

      .letter p {
        font-size: 1.4em;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Happy 2nd Monthsary, Aki! 💖</h1>

  <div class="letter">
    <p>
      Happy 2nd Month aki!!<br><br>
      I love you so muchhh. I will always fight for you, be a shoulder to cry on, make you happy and love you. <br><br>
      Mahal na Mahal kita so much akii ❤
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="photos">
    <img src="IMG_4267.JPG" alt="Photo 1">
    <img src="IMG_4269.JPG" alt="Photo 2">
    <img src="IMG_4270.JPG" alt="Photo 3">
  </div>

  <div class="music">
    <iframe style="border-radius:12px" 
      src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/3vkCueOmm7xQDoJ17W1Pm3?utm_source=generator" 
      width="100%" height="352" frameBorder="0" allowfullscreen="" 
      allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy">
    </iframe>
  </div>

  <footer>
    Made with 💌 for Aki — 2 months of love and counting...
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
